1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,157
This fluffy cloud weighs over 1 million pounds.

2
00:00:03,818 --> 00:00:06,251
That's as heavy as nearly 100 elephants.

3
00:00:06,924 --> 00:00:07,988
So why doesn't it fall?

4
00:00:08,497 --> 00:00:11,595
Its water is split into trillions of tiny droplets.

5
00:00:12,057 --> 00:00:15,637
Each one is so light that rising warm air holds it up.

6
00:00:16,079 --> 00:00:17,417
But here's the crazy part.

7
00:00:17,885 --> 00:00:20,954
The air in the same space weighs over 1,000× more.

8
00:00:21,443 --> 00:00:23,163
So it floats... even though...
